  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Civil Rights Defenders - yttrandefrihet</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Civil Rights Defenders on freedom of expression</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Civil Rights Defenders project &quot;Improving access to information and equality in Bosnia and Herzegovina 2016-2017&quot; har som ett &#xF6;vergripande m&#xE5;l att medborgerliga r&#xE4;ttigheter ska respekteras och uppr&#xE4;tth&#xE5;llas i BiH. Projektet har tre avsedda m&#xE5;l:
Resultat 1: Medborgare har befogenhet att h&#xE4;vda sina m&#xE4;nskliga r&#xE4;ttigheter (&#xF6;kad tillg&#xE5;ng till r&#xE4;ttshj&#xE4;lp, &#xF6;kad tillg&#xE5;ng till information)
&#x2022; Resultat 2: Staten tar st&#xF6;rre ansvar f&#xF6;r uppfyllandet av m&#xE4;nskliga r&#xE4;ttigheter (f&#xF6;rb&#xE4;ttrad lagstiftning om m&#xE4;nskliga r&#xE4;ttigheter, genomf&#xF6;rande av m&#xE4;nniskor&#xE4;ttsnormer f&#xF6;rb&#xE4;ttras)
&#x2022; Resultat 3: Lokala m&#xE4;nniskor&#xE4;ttsf&#xF6;rsvarare f&#xE5;r &#xF6;kad legitimitet (f&#xF6;rst&#xE4;rkt  organisatorisk kapacitet hos lokala m&#xE4;nniskor&#xE4;ttsf&#xF6;rsvarare, f&#xF6;rb&#xE4;ttrat skydd f&#xF6;r utsatta m&#xE4;nniskor&#xE4;ttsf&#xF6;rsvarare</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Civil Rights Defenders project &quot;Improving access to information and equality in Bosnia and Herzegovina 2016-2017&quot; has an overall goal of civil and political rights being respected and upheld in Bosnia and Herzegovina.
The intervention has three overall objectives:
&#x2022; Outcome 1: People are empowered to claim their human rights (increased access to legal aid, increased access to information) 
&#x2022; Outcome 2: States take better responsibility for the fulfillment of human rights (improved human rights legislation, implementation of human rights standards improves)
&#x2022; Outcome 3: Local human rights defenders are empowered (strengthening organizational capacity of local human rights defenders, improved protection for human rights defenders at risk)</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The intervention has three intended outcomes:&#x2022; Outcome 1: People are empowered to claim their human rights (increased access to legal aid, increased access to information) &#x2022; Outcome 2: States take better responsibility for the fulfillment of human rights (improved human rights legislation, implementation of human rights standards improves)&#x2022; Outcome 3: Local human rights defenders are empowered (strengthening organizational capacity of local human rights defenders, improved protection for human rights defenders at risk)</narrative>
  </description>
